    "name": "Cantrip Deck (Full Pack)",
    "type": "consumable",
    "img": "icons/placeholder/consumable.svg",
    "system": {
      "bulk": 0,
      "category": "other",
      "containerId": null,
      "damage": null,
      "description": "<p>In an effort to spread the knowledge of magic as widely as possible, worshippers of Nethys discovered a way to bind cantrips into cards accessible even to non-spellcasters. The deck contains thick parchment cards, each roughly half the size of a playing card. In precise, no-nonsense script, each card simply states the name of its cantrip, color-coded based on its school.</p>\n<p>This pack contains 24 cards-one of each cantrip in the Core Rulebook.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> or more (envision, Interact)</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You envision your desired cantrip, causing its card to rise to the top of the deck, and draw the card. The deck casts that cantrip as a 1st-rank spell, with a DC of 15 and a spell attack modifier of +5. The card crumbles into dust as the cantrip takes effect. The activation takes the same number of actions as the cantrip you chose takes to cast.</p>\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Acid Splash]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Void Warp]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Light]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Daze]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Detect Magic]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vitality Lash]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Divine Lance]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Electric Arc]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Forbidding Ward]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ghost Sound]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Guidance]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Know the Way]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Light]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Telekinetic Hand]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Message]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Prestidigitation]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ignition]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ray of Frost]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Read Aura]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shield]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sigil]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Stabilize]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Tangle Vine]</li>\n<li>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Telekinetic Projectile]</li>\n</ul>",
